اولا : تأكد أن الشخصية تمشي على الأرض
ثانيا : قم بتغير سرعة اللاعب على الرأسية ل -153
ثالثاً : أضف صوتية مناسبة

Here you have to make your player jump:
1- Check if player is walking (vy==0)
2- change vy to (-153)
2- Add sound effect</comment><statement name="HANDLER"><block type="controls_if" id="M~?fG[*V?{V+O(qfj1mE"><value name="IF0"><shadow type="logic_boolean" id="K~M$!$NDsK@qTD#BDaf5"><field name="BOOL">TRUE</field></shadow><block type="logic_compare" id="k1?yA(cyd+4D@xOd1(Ns"><field name="OP">EQ</field><value name="A"><shadow type="math_number" id="2s}?~ukmL.aB,lK7`=;H"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="Sprite_blockCombine_get" id="%Bv*Jw^DHP9njh3J~.vG"><field name="property">Sprite.vy</field><value name="mySprite"><block type="variables_get" id="I:~GsvC5q1H@@SP7p,H+"><field name="VAR" id="b*S2Y6*5^R:He:#)ff]s">mySprite</field></block></value></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="{}%rDofaQL([lMz*#E%_"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="music_playable_play" id="x*H=a;wQ*Z9e{8U8Pv2R"><field name="playbackMode">music.PlaybackMode.InBackground</field><value name="toPlay"><shadow type="music_melody_playable" id="8hiDO.1b3QTA3|:v@`/_"><field name="melody">music.baDing</field></shadow><block type="soundExpression_createSoundEffect" id="zWSENm5I2_5ihdD$yLsD" inline="true"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" _expanded="0" _input_init="true"></mutation><field name="waveShape">WaveShape.Square</field><field name="effect">SoundExpressionEffect.None</field><field name="interpolation">InterpolationCurve.Linear</field><value name="startFrequency"><shadow type="math_number_minmax" id="l9Y$pDAHj2MuZUolPpp("><mutation min="0" max="5000" precision="0"></mutation><field name="SLIDER">400</field></shadow></value><value name="endFrequency"><shadow type="math_number_minmax" id="j.I6Dw1cx)y:MyjYespP"><mutation min="0" max="5000" precision="0"></mutation><field name="SLIDER">600</field></shadow></value><value name="duration"><shadow type="math_number_minmax" id="JtWZpKiv`Ar32wHq]]_f"><mutation min="1" max="9999" precision="0"></mutation><field name="SLIDER">100</field></shadow></value